    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "models/gemini-3.1-flash-lite",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "Gemini 3.1 Flash Lite"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=\nAnalyze the customer lead using all the provided form data.\n\nIMPORTANT RULES:\n\n1. Check the lead_intent field first.\n\n2. If lead_intent is \"immediate\":\n   - Treat the lead as urgent.\n   - Set priority to \"High\".\n   - Set lead_temperature to \"Hot\".\n   - Set buying_intent to \"High\".\n   - Recommend contacting the customer as soon as possible.\n   - Set follow_up_timing to \"Immediately\".\n   - Do not classify the lead as Cold only because the project description or budget details are missing.\n\n3. If lead_intent is \"planning\":\n   - Evaluate the lead normally.\n   - Set priority and lead_temperature based on the available information.\n\n4. If lead_intent is \"research\":\n   - Evaluate the lead as an early-stage prospect.\n\n5. Missing information should be listed separately.\n   Do not assume that missing budget or project details mean low buying intent.\n\nReturn valid JSON only with these fields:\nlead_temperature, priority, buying_intent, budget_assessment,\nlead_score, missing_information, ai_summary,\nrecommended_action, follow_up_timing, follow_up_method.\n\nCustomer data:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -816,
        -256
      ],
      "id": "96ac4738-76ee-431d-9f6b-3c031ac929f7",
      "name": "Message a model",
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "mC5AUn9ipFf6eHOV",
          "name": "Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account 2"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "\nconst item = $input.item.json;\n\n// Gemini ke response se text nikalein\nlet rawText = item.content?.parts?.[0]?.text ?? \"\";\n\nif (!rawText) {\n  throw new Error(\"Gemini response text nahi mila. Input JSON check karein.\");\n}\n\n// Agar Gemini ne Markdown code fence diya ho to hata dein\nrawText = rawText\n  .replace(/```json\\s*/i, \"\")\n  .replace(/```\\s*/g, \"\")\n  .trim();\n\n// JSON ko object mein convert karein\nconst analysis = JSON.parse(rawText);\n\n// Har AI field ko alag output field banayein\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    lead_temperature: analysis.lead_temperature,\n    priority: analysis.priority,\n    buying_intent: analysis.buying_intent,\n    budget_assessment: analysis.budget_assessment,\n    lead_score: analysis.lead_score,\n    missing_information: analysis.missing_information,\n    ai_summary: analysis.ai_summary,\n    recommended_action: analysis.recommended_action,\n    follow_up_timing: analysis.follow_up_timing,\n    follow_up_method: analysis.follow_up_method\n  }\n};\n"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
